// パッと見 (ROADMAP 11): the first problem of a section may show people on two 5-seat benches in a car passing the platform (0.35 s in, 0.8 s still or longer as set in おうちの方へ, 0.35 s out); with its own button (set per person) every problem of a section can be one. ▶ みる starts it, so it never passes while the child looks away, and it can be watched again until answered. While the car is watched it fills the panel and the keypad is hidden; the keypad comes back once it has passed. After an answer, right or not, the car stays in view, large, and the count is read in groups of 5 (not after the answer that opens a section, so it does not run into the drive's announcement); でんしゃが くるよ is read when the problem comes up by a tap (つぎの もんだい or しゅっぱつ) and なんにん のってた？ when the car has passed; a wrong answer has no retry sound, and こたえる brings the keypad back to type the count again.
